00:03:52.580 --> 00:03:53.659
Oh, I love it.
哦，我太喜欢了。

00:03:53.659 --> 00:04:05.659
And you've chosen the perfect moment to do State of the Union because this is episode 11 out of 22, almost all of the seasons were either 22 episodes or 24, 24 in success.
你选择了一个完美的时机来做这个总结，因为这是22集里的第11集，几乎所有的季数要么是22集，要么是24集，成功后变成了24集。

00:04:05.659 --> 00:04:09.060
Once we became sort of more of a hit, they're like, give us a couple extra a year.
