We didn't know what we're doing.
我们当时根本不知道自己在做什么。

00:04:53.060 --> 00:05:04.199
I think when you're in it and you're close to it and an episode's airing six weeks after you just made it, for me, my ego was just tied up in it in a different way than it is now.
我想当你身处其中，离它很近，而且一集剧在制作完成六周后就播出时，对我来说，我的自尊心与它捆绑的方式和现在不同。

00:05:04.199 --> 00:05:13.920
I watch it with so much more forgiveness and I'm marveling at the fact that I was involved in this charming show that continues to delight people.
我现在带着更多的宽容去观看，并对这样一个事实感到惊叹：我参与了这部迷人的剧集，它至今仍在给人们带来快乐。

00:05:13.920 --> 00:05:31.139
