那是那个年纪、那一分钟的你，在那一刻存在于地球上，再次观看它，就像是回到了过去。

00:08:10.920 --> 00:08:18.879
Like, I'm having a little bit of that kind of vertigo of like, I remember I was standing off to the side at Video Village watching the four cameras, you know, the four monitors showing the four camera shots.
就像，我有一种轻微的眩晕感，就像我记得我当时站在视频村（Video Village）旁边，看着那四个监视器，显示着四个摄像机的画面。

00:08:18.879 --> 00:08:19.720
But what is it?
但那是什么呢？

00:08:19.720 --> 00:08:27.360
Is there kind of like a weird emotional vertigo of trying to like remember your way back into like what it looked like, say within that limo?
是否有一种奇怪的情感眩晕，试图回忆起当时在豪华轿车里是什么样子？

00:08:27.360 --> 00:08:29.600
That just occurred to me.
我刚才突然想到了这一点。

00:08:29.600 --> 00:08:37.679
